Company: Kestra
Summary: Kestra (kestra.io) is an open-source workflow orchestration platform for automating, running, and monitoring workflows across infrastructure, data, AI, and other systems. It offers workflow creation as code, via a UI, and with AI-assisted authoring, and is positioned as a scalable, declarative, AI-native orchestration solution.

